(-.15,-.25,.2),([-.85,.85],[-1,.65],[.02,.75]),('Kindred support is plausible but resource duties and coverage remain uncertain.','Kin institutions coexist with consequential Ancestor Core dependence.','Biological Kin retain mining, care and administration; Ironkin work is separately disclosed.'),
